      "content": "i've tried the small things. i've talked to people. it just doesn't work. it's not even like i'm \"sad\" really... sadness has a shape. this is just... nothing. it's like i'm a ghost living in a world that's too bright and too loud and i'm just perpetually hollow. i feel like i'm just waiting for something to happen that never does. it's just so heavy.",
